views the same scan and report, and can refer the patient on to a specialist."}],"\n",["$","$L2b","pre-0,code-0",{"chart":"flowchart LR\n  S[Scan upload] --> A[AI screening]\n  A --> R[Report]\n  R --> D[Doctor review]\n  D --> F[Specialist referral]\n  D --> B[Appointment]"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"className":"mb-5 max-w-[62ch] text-body last:mb-0","children":"The screening is decision support, not a diagnosis. Every result is meant to be reviewed by a doctor."}]]}]}]]}],["$","div","2-For patients",{"className":"grid-12 gap-y-6 border-t border-line py-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem)] first:border-t-0 first:pt-0","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"col-span-12 lg:col-span-4","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:sticky lg:top-28","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-meta text-muted","children":["(","03",")"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-[clamp(1.875rem,3.4vw,3rem)]","children":"For patients"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"col-span-12 lg:col-span-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","ul","ul-0",{"className":"prose-list mb-6 max-w-[62ch]","children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"className":"relative border-t border-line py-3.5 pl-7 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"className":"font-medium","children":"AI health assistant."}]," Symptom questions and medication information, answered through retrieval-augmented generation over a Pinecone vector index."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"className":"relative border-t border-line py-3.5 pl-7 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"className":"font-medium","children":"Image screening."}]," Chest X-rays are screened for pneumonia and other chest conditions, and skin photos for dermatological conditions. Both models run on ONNX Runtime, and a Grad-CAM heatmap shows which part of the image the model looked at."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"className":"relative border-t border-line py-3.5 pl-7 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0 last:pb-0","children":["$L2c"," A timeline of scans and results, with a downloadable PDF report."]}],"\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n"]}]]}]}]]}],"$L31","$L32"]}]]}]}]
